SUMMARY:Summerlicious at Yorkville's STK Steakhouse (Bay Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Friday\, July 17th\, join us for anot
 her Summerlicious at STK Steakhouse and Cocktail lounge\, for a steak\, se
 afood and the ultimate VIBE dining experience.** STK Toronto artfully blen
 ds the modern steakhouse and a chic lounge into one\, offering a dynamic f
 ine dining experience with the superior quality of a traditional steakhous
 e\, world-class service and the perfect ambiance. STK was recently renovat
 ed last November\, and is an international restaurant with locations acros
 s the US\, Europe\, the Middle East and Mexico. Join me tonight for a love
 ly fine dining experience\n\n**MENU**\n***APPETIZER (choice)***\nBURRATA -
  marinated heirloom tomatoes\, olive tapenade\, croutons (V)\n\nTUNA TARTA
 RE - hass avocado\, taro chips\, soy-honey emulsion\n\nLIL' BRGS - wagyu b
 eef\, special sauce\, pickle\, tomato\, sesame seed bun\n\n***ENTREE (choi
 ce)***\nCALI CUT NY 7oz -confit fingerling potatoes\,\nparmesan gremolata\
 , chimichurri sauce\n\nMAPLE RUBBED SALMON - pickled cherry\, tomatoes\, p
 iquillo broccolini\, olive dressing (G)\n\nWILD MUSHROOM RISOTTO - pecorin
 o\, braised mushrooms\, baby spinach\, shaved black truffle (V)\n\nSHRIMP 
 SCAMPI - sauteed shrimp \, linguine\, tomato\, garlic white wine sauce\n\n
 ***DESSERT (choice\, all V)***\nBAKED APPLE CRUMBLE - salted caramel ice c
 ream\n\nCHEESECAKE - raspberry couli\, berries\n\nCHOCOLATE CAKE - chocola
 te ganache sauce (G)\n\n**COST**\nSummerlicious Dinner: $75 + tax + gratui
 ty\nOrganizer Meetup fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* RSVP Yes. Everyone goe
 s on the waitlist until they have reserved their seat.\n* To reserve your 
 seat at the table\, an etransfer of $25 (includes $5 meetup fee) is requir
 ed. Attendees will be etransferred back $20 the day after the event. There
  are no refunds for any reason.\n* Once you are on the waitlist\, I will m
 essage you my email for the etransfer.\n* Once the transfer is complete\, 
 I will move you to attending.\n* A reminder will be sent the night before 
 with my cell and all meetup details. Make sure you set up your communicati
 on settings to receive.\n\nRSVPs close Tuesday July 14th. Cancellations wi
 ll result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n*
 *Meet me at: 7pm inside the front doors of STK at 153 Yorkville Ave.** Ple
 ase wait for me to arrive\, and do not sit on your own prior\, so we can g
 et the table requested.\n\nLength: 2 hours\n\nEnjoy and please post your C
 omments in the event after.
