SUMMARY:The Odyssey Action Fantasy in AVX + Dinner (Eglinton Stn.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note**: **AVX show time will be confirme
 d once Cineplex updates their movie times for that week\, latest the Wedne
 sday before.**\n\nOn **Saturday July 25th\,** let's see **The Odyssey\, fo
 recasted as the number 1 movie for Summer 2026.** ***The Odyssey*** is an 
 upcoming [epic](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epic_film "Epic film") [fant
 asy action film](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fantasy_action_film "Fantas
 y action film") written and directed by [Christopher Nolan](https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/Christopher_Nolan "Christopher Nolan"). An adaptation of [
 Homer](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Homer "Homer")'s [ancient Greek](http
 s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_Greek "Ancient Greek") epic the *[Odysse
 y](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odyssey "Odyssey")*\, the film stars [Mat
 t Damon](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matt_Damon "Matt Damon") as [Odysse
 us](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus "Odysseus")\, the Greek king of
  [Ithaca](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Homer%27s_Ithaca "Homer's Ithaca")
 \, and chronicles his long and perilous journey home after the [Trojan War
 ](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trojan_War "Trojan War") as he attempts to
  reunite with his wife\, [Penelope](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penelope
  "Penelope")\, portrayed by [Anne Hathaway](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/
 Anne_Hathaway "Anne Hathaway"). The [ensemble cast](https://en.wikipedia.o
 rg/wiki/Ensemble_cast "Ensemble cast") includes [Tom Holland](https://en.w
 ikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Holland "Tom Holland")\, [Robert Pattinson](https://
 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Pattinson "Robert Pattinson")\, [Lupita Nyong
 'o](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lupita_Nyong%27o "Lupita Nyong'o")\, [Ze
 ndaya](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zendaya "Zendaya")\, and [Charlize Th
 eron](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlize_Theron "Charlize Theron"). **
 My seat is TBD. Purchase your tickets for The Odyssey on Saturday July 25t
 h at TBC time AVX show at Yonge Eglinton Station.**\n\n**COST**\nAdult $23
 .25/ Senior $18.50/ CineClub $11.00 + tzxes\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* **Simpl
 y RSVP Yes confirming Yes/No to food/drinks after**\n* **[Purchase](https:
 //www.cineplex.com/search?q=odyssey)** **your own ticket by selecting Get 
 Tickets\, Saturday July 25th\, The Odyssey\, Yonge Eglinton Station\, AVX 
 Show at time TBC**\n* You can also meet the group at the meetup time with 
 your ticket in hand\n* RSVPs close the day prior\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Mee
 t me at: time TBC in front of AVX Auditorium TBC inside Cineplex Yonge Egl
 inton Station at 2300 Yonge St**\n\n**Show starts**: TBC\n\nLength: 2 hour
 s 52 minutes\n\nAfter: meet me outside AVX Auditorium TBC to head out for 
 food/drinks nearby\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the event aft
 er.
